{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big/core：X的大字串起了想靠近、害怕给对方负担、对方没有退开、越来越舍不得失去这份亲近的关系主线，幸福与留不住它的痛楚都落在具体的人际关系里；Y的大块更多是在概括自己的内心状态，关系本身不够清楚。small：X的小字补出了对视不尴尬、温柔的刺、独处时泛酸等具体细节，整体与大字挂得上，Y则有一些感受和大字重复。concise/human：X虽然多次回到舍不得和害怕失去，但每次都有关系发展的新信息；Y重复强调不能保证、想维持和提前惋惜，而且“和这份亲近待在一起”“想要更多的渴求悬着没有满足”“留下低低的回望”等搭配不够自然。fine：Y略胜，感受块更集中于观众当下的身体和心理体验，X有不少内容转向描写声部、低音和琶音等音乐本身。load：X每屏主要是短小、容易识别的重点词组，Y的大字经常是多块较长的完整句子，尤其短停留屏，扫读负担明显更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7e605b01-8ec1-4728-8d31-da198fe7cc9a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T131452575551Z", "elapsed_seconds": 295.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T13:19:47.998154+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fa5067c7b17e18eae4055bfc2477f775d450fdfe55cff16086ec1b50c5ad1189", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fa